Package: jarvis-lock
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Muhammad AbdElHay <mmAbdelhay@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: jarvis-ui (= @VERSION@), libpam-runtime, libpam-modules
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: @DISTRO_NAME@ lock screen
 Locks the Wayland session (ext-session-lock-v1) and unlocks it with the
 user's password through the PAM service jarvis-lock. While the screen is
 locked, the Jarvis agent refuses to carry out approvals.
